### 3. Screen Mockups & Visualizations
Since we cannot run the GUI of Power BI Desktop directly, we will use our `generate_image` tool to create four high-fidelity, professional-grade mockups representing the final design of each page, matching the Bluestock brand colors (deep indigo and blue):
